	<!-- FaqSeo -->
	
  <script type="application/ld+json" data-type="seo" data-object-type="FAQPage" data-id="4077bc12-38c6-4e59-bb21-db8710a7ecc9">{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"FAQPage","@id":"https://www.samsung.com/pk/smartphones/galaxy-s/galaxy-s25-fe-navy-256gb-sm-s731bdbvpkd/#FAQ","inLanguage":"en-PK","about":{"@id":"https://www.samsung.com/pk/smartphones/galaxy-s/galaxy-s25-fe-navy-256gb-sm-s731bdbvpkd/"},"mainEntity":[{"@type":"Question","name":"What languages does Galaxy AI support?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"As of July 11, 2025, Galaxy AI's Call Assist (e.g. Live Translate), Note Assist, Browsing Assist, Interpreter, and Transcript Assist currently support the following 20 languages: Korean, English, Spanish, French, German, Italian, Portuguese, Chinese, Japanese, Polish, Hindi, Thai, Vietnamese, Arabic, Indonesian, Russian, Turkish, Dutch, Swedish and Romanian."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What languages does Writing Assist support?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Writing Assist currently supports the following 39 languages: English, Portuguese, Spanish, French, Korean, German, Italian, Chinese (Simplified, Traditional), Japanese, Hindi, Polish, Thai, Vietnamese, Arabic, Russian, Indonesian, Turkish, Dutch, Swedish, Romanian, Czech, Danish, Finnish, Hungarian, Ukrainian, Hebrew, Greek, Serbian, Bulgarian, Croatian, Norwegian, Slovak, Lithuanian, Slovenian, Latvian, Estonian, Bengali and Swahili."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What colors does Galaxy S25 FE come in?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Galaxy S25 FE is available in four stunning colors: Navy, Jetblack, Icyblue and White. It also features a stylish bi-color frame that adds a unique and distinctive look."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What has changed with Galaxy S25 FE's design?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Galaxy S25 FE is slimmer, sleeker and lighter than Galaxy S24 FE with thinner bezels and a larger screen-to-body ratio. Below are the specifications of both models: Galaxy S25 FE- Dimension: 161.3 mm x 76.6 mm x 7.4 mm- Weight: 190 g- Bezel Size (Upper/Lower/Left): 1.47 mm / 2.51 mm / 1.47 mm- Screen-to-body Ratio: 90.19 % Galaxy S24 FE- Dimension: 162.0 mm x 77.3 mm x 8.0 mm- Weight: 213 g- Bezel Size (Upper/Lower/Left): 2.19 mm / 3.33 mm / 1.99 mm- Screen-to-body Ratio: 87.9 %"}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What AI features are available on Galaxy S25 FE?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"In addition to Google Gemini and Circle to Search, Galaxy S25 FE comes equipped with a wide range of its own AI features, including Photo Assist, Drawing Assist, Audio Eraser, Note Assist, Transcript Assist, Browsing Assist, Now Brief, Routine, Gallery Search, Chat Translate, Interpreter, Call Assist, Writing Assist and Reply Recommendation.Galaxy S25 FE also offers Intelligent Features under “Galaxy AI\", including Object Eraser, Edit Suggestion, Live Effect, Filters, Best Face, Auto Trim, Read Aloud and AI Select. Other features include Now Bar, Wallpaper and Instant Slow-mo."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Is the camera better than Galaxy S24 FE?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"While the main cameras are the same, Galaxy S25 FE features an upgraded 12 MP front camera (up from 10 MP), delivering clearer selfies and sharper video calls."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"How long does Galaxy S25 FE battery last?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"With a 4,900 mAh battery, Galaxy S25 FE is built for reliable, all-day performance. Under typical use, you can expect up to more than a full day's worth of battery life. For more demanding activities like gaming or streaming, screen-on time typically lasts around a quarter of a day."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Does Galaxy S25 FE support wireless charging?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Galaxy S25 FE supports wireless charging at up to 15 W. It also offers 45 W fast charging via a wired connection, giving you flexible options depending on your needs."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Can I use a 45 W charger for Galaxy S25 FE?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes, Galaxy S25 FE supports fast charging up to wired 45 W charger. With a compatible charger, you can fully charge the device in under an hour. It also supports wireless charging up to 15 W, though that method takes a bit longer."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Is Galaxy S25 FE waterproof?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Galaxy S25 FE is rated IP68 for water and dust resistance. This means it can handle being submerged in up to 1.5 meters of freshwater for up to 30 minutes under lab conditions. It's well protected against everyday spills and rain, but extended exposure to water — especially saltwater or high-pressure streams — should still be avoided."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Can I transfer my data from iOS?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes, transferring data from an iOS device is simple with Samsung’s Smart Switch app. You can move contacts, photos, messages, apps, and more — either wirelessly or with a USB cable — for a smooth transition to your new phone."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"How is my data protected on Galaxy S25 FE?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Galaxy S25 FE features advanced security technology to help protect your personal information. Samsung Knox Vault safeguards sensitive data like passwords and biometrics in a secure hardware environment. The phone also processes much of your data locally to enhance privacy, and includes post-quantum cryptography for added future protection. With One UI’s privacy controls, you can easily manage what data is shared. Theft protection features provide an added layer of security if your device is ever lost or stolen."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"How much is the Samsung Galaxy S25 FE?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"The Samsung Galaxy S25 FE is priced at Rs.219,999 in Pakistan for the 256GB eStore exclusive model."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What processor powers the Galaxy S25 FE?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"The Galaxy S25 FE is powered by the Exynos 2400 processor built on a 4nm process, delivering strong efficiency and flagship-level performance."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"How much RAM and storage do the Galaxy S25 FE models offer?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"The Galaxy S25 FE comes with 8GB of RAM and 256GB of internal storage in the eStore exclusive model available in Pakistan."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What are the display sizes and screen types of the Galaxy S25 FE?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"The phone features a 6.7-inch Dynamic AMOLED 2X display with a 120Hz refresh rate, providing smooth scrolling and vivid color reproduction."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What are the camera specifications of the Galaxy S25 FE?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"The Galaxy S25 FE has a triple rear camera system with a 50MP wide main sensor with OIS, a 12MP ultra-wide sensor, and an 8MP telephoto lens with 3x optical zoom, alongside a 12MP front camera for selfies."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Does the Galaxy S25 FE support fast charging?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes, the Galaxy S25 FE supports fast charging with 45W wired charging and 15W wireless charging for quick power top-ups."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What materials are used in the design of the Galaxy S25 FE?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"The phone is constructed with Gorilla Glass Victus+ on the back and an aluminum frame, offering both durability and a premium design."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What connectivity options does the Galaxy S25 FE support?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes, the Galaxy S25 FE supports connectivity features such as 5G, 4G LTE, Wi-Fi, Bluetooth, USB-C, and eSIM."}}]}</script>


	
		
		
			

    

    

    

    

    

    

    

    

    

    

    

    

    

    

    

    
    
    

    

     



	
	
