										<img class="image__main responsive-img lazy-load" data-desktop-src="//images.samsung.com/is/image/samsung/p6pim/pk/feature/166449611/pk-feature-galaxy-s25-fe-sm-s731-549132765?$900_N_JPG$" data-mobile-src="//images.samsung.com/is/image/samsung/p6pim/pk/feature/166449611/pk-feature-galaxy-s25-fe-sm-s731-549132766?$550_N_JPG$" data-desktop-alt="A smartphone screen shows battery info: 80 % charge with 21 hr 24 min left, full charge lasts 1 d 2 hr. Options for Power saving, Background usage limits, and Battery protection are visible. Text below reads &#39;Battery capacity 4,900 mAh&#39; and &#39;Watch Video up to 28 hrs.&#39;" data-mobile-alt="A smartphone screen shows battery info: 80 % charge with 21 hr 24 min left, full charge lasts 1 d 2 hr. Options for Power saving, Background usage limits, and Battery protection are visible. Text below reads &#39;Battery capacity 4,900 mAh&#39; and &#39;Watch Video up to 28 hrs.&#39;" data-comp-name="image" role="img"/>
