					<h2 class="feature-benefit-full-bleed__title" data-font-size-pc="48" data-font-size-mo="30">Slimmer, lighter and ready to impress
					</h2>
					
					<p class="feature-benefit-full-bleed__text" data-font-size-pc="18" data-font-size-mo="12">At just 7.4 mm thin and 190 grams light, Galaxy S25 FE is the thinnest and lightest FE phone yet. It also features the slimmest bezels to date, paired with a floating camera design for a sleek look and a more immersive viewing experience. Carry less, enjoy more.						
					</p>
					
					<!--context html-->
					
						<span class="feature-benefit-full-bleed__disclaimer">*Compared to Galaxy S24 FE*Thickness measured from the top glass panel to the bottom glass panel.</span>	
					
