			</h2>
			
			<p class="feature-benefit-text-only__description">Inspired by the S series design heritage, Galaxy S25 FE comes in four trendy colors in a Premium Haze finish: Navy, Jetblack, Icyblue and White. It also features a bi-color frame for a unique and distinctive look, ensuring your style is always on point.
