									</h2>
									<div class="feature-benefit__desc-wrap">
																			
										<p class="feature-benefit__desc contrast-target" data-font-size-mo="12" data-font-size-pc="18">Audio Eraser helps remove background noise from your recordings for clear, high-quality sound. Whether you're in a cafe, on a busy street, or at a crowded event, it filters out unwanted noise, so your recordings stay crisp and focused.
										</p>
										
									</div>
								</div>
