							<div class="ftd16-interactive-multi-feature__bottom">
								<h3 class="ftd16-interactive-multi-feature__headline">Browsing Assist.Instantly summarize web content
								</h3>
								
								<p class="ftd16-interactive-multi-feature__description">Browsing Assist helps you digest long articles faster, summarizing key info and translating web pages right in Samsung Internet. Save time, understand more and get straight to what matters most every time you&#39;re on the web.
								</p>
								<span class="ftd16-interactive-multi-feature__disclaimer">*Availability of features may vary by device model, language and browser version. Requires internet connection and Samsung Internet version 28.0 or later. Translation and summarization accuracy may vary depending on content complexity.</span>
							</div>
						</div>
					</div>
				  
					<div class="ftd16-interactive-multi-feature__swiper-item swiper-slide" role="listitem" data-tagging='{
