						<div class="ftd16-interactive-multi-feature__swiper-inner">
							
							<div class="ftd16-interactive-multi-feature__top">
								<div class="ftd16-interactive-multi-feature__image">
									<div class="image">
										<img class="image__preview lazy-load responsive-img" data-desktop-src="//images.samsung.com/is/image/samsung/p6pim/pk/feature/166449593/pk-feature-writing-assist-your-note-taking-buddy-548716482?$LazyLoad_Home_JPG$" data-mobile-src="//images.samsung.com/is/image/samsung/p6pim/pk/feature/166449593/pk-feature-writing-assist-your-note-taking-buddy-548716483?$LazyLoad_Home_JPG$" data-desktop-alt="A smartphone screen showing an email composition interface addressed to &#39;Kevin.&#39; The email text reads, &#39;Just checking if you&#39;re free for a short meeting tomorrow. Let me know what time works for you.&#39; Below are two suggested responses labeled &#39;Professional&#39; and &#39;Casual.&#39;" data-mobile-alt="A smartphone screen showing an email composition interface addressed to &#39;Kevin.&#39; The email text reads, &#39;Just checking if you&#39;re free for a short meeting tomorrow. Let me know what time works for you.&#39; Below are two suggested responses labeled &#39;Professional&#39; and &#39;Casual.&#39;" data-comp-name="image" role="img"/>
										<img class="image__main responsive-img lazy-load" data-desktop-src="//images.samsung.com/is/image/samsung/p6pim/pk/feature/166449593/pk-feature-writing-assist-your-note-taking-buddy-548716482?$900_N_JPG$" data-mobile-src="//images.samsung.com/is/image/samsung/p6pim/pk/feature/166449593/pk-feature-writing-assist-your-note-taking-buddy-548716483?$550_N_JPG$" data-desktop-alt="A smartphone screen showing an email composition interface addressed to &#39;Kevin.&#39; The email text reads, &#39;Just checking if you&#39;re free for a short meeting tomorrow. Let me know what time works for you.&#39; Below are two suggested responses labeled &#39;Professional&#39; and &#39;Casual.&#39;" data-mobile-alt="A smartphone screen showing an email composition interface addressed to &#39;Kevin.&#39; The email text reads, &#39;Just checking if you&#39;re free for a short meeting tomorrow. Let me know what time works for you.&#39; Below are two suggested responses labeled &#39;Professional&#39; and &#39;Casual.&#39;" data-comp-name="image" role="img"/>
									</div>
								</div>
							</div>

							
							

								
							
							
							<div class="ftd16-interactive-multi-feature__bottom">
								<h3 class="ftd16-interactive-multi-feature__headline">Writing Assist.Your note-taking buddy
								</h3>
								
								<p class="ftd16-interactive-multi-feature__description">Write better and quicker with Writing Assist. It helps you polish grammar, rephrase sentences and match the right tone — whether you&#39;re texting, emailing or taking notes. Just type your thoughts, and let AI elevate your words with clarity and style.
								</p>
								<span class="ftd16-interactive-multi-feature__disclaimer">*Writing Assist requires a network connection and Samsung Account login. Must meet length requirements to activate feature. Service availability may vary by language. Accuracy of results is not guaranteed.</span>
							</div>
						</div>
					</div>
				   
				</div>
			
