                                <h3 class="three-column-carousel__text__headline">Built to last with 7x OS upgrades
                                </h3>
                                <p class="three-column-carousel__text__description">Galaxy S25 FE supports up to 7 generations of OS upgrades and up to 7 years of security updates to keep it running as good as new.
                                </p>
                                <p class="three-column-carousel__text__disclaimer">*Availability and timing of Android OS upgrades and security updates may vary by device model and market.</p>
                            </div>
                            
