    <section class="ftd22-faq bg-white">
        <div class="ftd22-faq__inner">
            
            <div class="ftd22-faq__headline-wrap">
                <p id="featureBottomDiclaimerGoBack166684982" class="ftd22-faq__headline">Frequently Asked Questions
                    
                </p>
                
            </div>
            
                
                <div class="ftd22-faq__accordion ftd22-faq__accordion--expanded">
                    <p class="ftd22-faq__accordion-title">
                        <button class="ftd22-faq__accordion-title-cta" data-js-action="ftd22AccordionOpen">
                            What languages does Galaxy AI support?
                            
                        </button>
                    </p>
                    <div class="ftd22-faq__accordion-content-wrap">
                        <div class="ftd22-faq__accordion-content">
                            <p class="ftd22-faq__accordion-desc">As of July 11, 2025, Galaxy AI's Call Assist (e.g. Live Translate), Note Assist, Browsing Assist, Interpreter, and Transcript Assist currently support the following 20 languages: Korean, English, Spanish, French, German, Italian, Portuguese, Chinese, Japanese, Polish, Hindi, Thai, Vietnamese, Arabic, Indonesian, Russian, Turkish, Dutch, Swedish and Romanian.
                                
                            </p>
                            <p class="ftd22-faq__accordion-disclaimer"></p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            
                
                <div class="ftd22-faq__accordion ">
                    <p class="ftd22-faq__accordion-title">
                        <button class="ftd22-faq__accordion-title-cta" data-js-action="ftd22AccordionOpen">
                            What languages does Writing Assist support?
                            
                        </button>
                    </p>
                    <div class="ftd22-faq__accordion-content-wrap">
                        <div class="ftd22-faq__accordion-content">
                            <p class="ftd22-faq__accordion-desc">Writing Assist currently supports the following 39 languages: English, Portuguese, Spanish, French, Korean, German, Italian, Chinese (Simplified, Traditional), Japanese, Hindi, Polish, Thai, Vietnamese, Arabic, Russian, Indonesian, Turkish, Dutch, Swedish, Romanian, Czech, Danish, Finnish, Hungarian, Ukrainian, Hebrew, Greek, Serbian, Bulgarian, Croatian, Norwegian, Slovak, Lithuanian, Slovenian, Latvian, Estonian, Bengali and Swahili.
                                
                            </p>
                            <p class="ftd22-faq__accordion-disclaimer"></p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            
                
                <div class="ftd22-faq__accordion ">
                    <p class="ftd22-faq__accordion-title">
                        <button class="ftd22-faq__accordion-title-cta" data-js-action="ftd22AccordionOpen">
                            What colors does Galaxy S25 FE come in?
                            
                        </button>
                    </p>
                    <div class="ftd22-faq__accordion-content-wrap">
                        <div class="ftd22-faq__accordion-content">
                            <p class="ftd22-faq__accordion-desc">Galaxy S25 FE is available in four stunning colors: Navy, Jetblack, Icyblue and White. It also features a stylish bi-color frame that adds a unique and distinctive look.
                                
                            </p>
                            <p class="ftd22-faq__accordion-disclaimer">*Color availability may vary depending on country/region or carrier.</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            
                
                <div class="ftd22-faq__accordion ">
                    <p class="ftd22-faq__accordion-title">
                        <button class="ftd22-faq__accordion-title-cta" data-js-action="ftd22AccordionOpen">
                            What has changed with Galaxy S25 FE&#39;s design?
                            
                        </button>
                    </p>
                    <div class="ftd22-faq__accordion-content-wrap">
                        <div class="ftd22-faq__accordion-content">
                            <p class="ftd22-faq__accordion-desc">Galaxy S25 FE is slimmer, sleeker and lighter than Galaxy S24 FE with thinner bezels and a larger screen-to-body ratio. Below are the specifications of both models: Galaxy S25 FE- Dimension: 161.3 mm x 76.6 mm x 7.4 mm- Weight: 190 g- Bezel Size (Upper/Lower/Left): 1.47 mm / 2.51 mm / 1.47 mm- Screen-to-body Ratio: 90.19 % Galaxy S24 FE- Dimension: 162.0 mm x 77.3 mm x 8.0 mm- Weight: 213 g- Bezel Size (Upper/Lower/Left): 2.19 mm / 3.33 mm / 1.99 mm- Screen-to-body Ratio: 87.9 %
                                
                            </p>
                            <p class="ftd22-faq__accordion-disclaimer"></p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            
                
                <div class="ftd22-faq__accordion ">
                    <p class="ftd22-faq__accordion-title">
                        <button class="ftd22-faq__accordion-title-cta" data-js-action="ftd22AccordionOpen">
                            What AI features are available on Galaxy S25 FE?
                            
                        </button>
                    </p>
                    <div class="ftd22-faq__accordion-content-wrap">
                        <div class="ftd22-faq__accordion-content">
                            <p class="ftd22-faq__accordion-desc">In addition to Google Gemini and Circle to Search, Galaxy S25 FE comes equipped with a wide range of its own AI features, including Photo Assist, Drawing Assist, Audio Eraser, Note Assist, Transcript Assist, Browsing Assist, Now Brief, Routine, Gallery Search, Chat Translate, Interpreter, Call Assist, Writing Assist and Reply Recommendation.Galaxy S25 FE also offers Intelligent Features under “Galaxy AI&quot;, including Object Eraser, Edit Suggestion, Live Effect, Filters, Best Face, Auto Trim, Read Aloud and AI Select. Other features include Now Bar, Wallpaper and Instant Slow-mo.
                                
                            </p>
                            <p class="ftd22-faq__accordion-disclaimer">*Gemini is a trademark of Google LLC. Circle to Search is a trademark of Google LLC.*Samsung account login may be required to use certain AI features.*Samsung does not make any promises, assurances or guarantees as to the accuracy, completeness or reliability of the output provided by AI features.*Availability of Galaxy AI features may vary depending on the region/country, OS/One UI version, device model, and phone carrier.*Galaxy AI features will be provided for free until the end of 2025 on supported Samsung Galaxy devices. Different terms may apply for AI features provided by third parties.*Galaxy AI service may be limited for minors in certain regions with age restrictions over AI usage.</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            
                
                <div class="ftd22-faq__accordion ">
                    <p class="ftd22-faq__accordion-title">
                        <button class="ftd22-faq__accordion-title-cta" data-js-action="ftd22AccordionOpen">
                            Is the camera better than Galaxy S24 FE?
                            
                        </button>
                    </p>
                    <div class="ftd22-faq__accordion-content-wrap">
                        <div class="ftd22-faq__accordion-content">
                            <p class="ftd22-faq__accordion-desc">While the main cameras are the same, Galaxy S25 FE features an upgraded 12 MP front camera (up from 10 MP), delivering clearer selfies and sharper video calls.
                                
                            </p>
                            <p class="ftd22-faq__accordion-disclaimer">*Compared to Galaxy S24 FE</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            
                
                <div class="ftd22-faq__accordion ">
                    <p class="ftd22-faq__accordion-title">
                        <button class="ftd22-faq__accordion-title-cta" data-js-action="ftd22AccordionOpen">
                            How long does Galaxy S25 FE battery last?
                            
                        </button>
                    </p>
                    <div class="ftd22-faq__accordion-content-wrap">
                        <div class="ftd22-faq__accordion-content">
                            <p class="ftd22-faq__accordion-desc">With a 4,900 mAh battery, Galaxy S25 FE is built for reliable, all-day performance. Under typical use, you can expect up to more than a full day's worth of battery life. For more demanding activities like gaming or streaming, screen-on time typically lasts around a quarter of a day.
                                
                            </p>
                            <p class="ftd22-faq__accordion-disclaimer">*Actual battery life may vary depending on network environment, app usage, feature settings, call and message frequency, charging habits and other factors. The rated capacity of Galaxy S25 FE is 4,755 mAh. Battery performance is estimated based on average user usage profiles compiled by UX Connect Research.</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            
                
                <div class="ftd22-faq__accordion ">
                    <p class="ftd22-faq__accordion-title">
                        <button class="ftd22-faq__accordion-title-cta" data-js-action="ftd22AccordionOpen">
                            Does Galaxy S25 FE support wireless charging?
                            
                        </button>
                    </p>
                    <div class="ftd22-faq__accordion-content-wrap">
                        <div class="ftd22-faq__accordion-content">
                            <p class="ftd22-faq__accordion-desc">Galaxy S25 FE supports wireless charging at up to 15 W. It also offers 45 W fast charging via a wired connection, giving you flexible options depending on your needs.
                                
                            </p>
                            <p class="ftd22-faq__accordion-disclaimer"></p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            
                
                <div class="ftd22-faq__accordion ">
                    <p class="ftd22-faq__accordion-title">
                        <button class="ftd22-faq__accordion-title-cta" data-js-action="ftd22AccordionOpen">
                            Can I use a 45 W charger for Galaxy S25 FE?
                            
                        </button>
                    </p>
                    <div class="ftd22-faq__accordion-content-wrap">
                        <div class="ftd22-faq__accordion-content">
                            <p class="ftd22-faq__accordion-desc">Yes, Galaxy S25 FE supports fast charging up to wired 45 W charger. With a compatible charger, you can fully charge the device in under an hour. It also supports wireless charging up to 15 W, though that method takes a bit longer.
                                
                            </p>
                            <p class="ftd22-faq__accordion-disclaimer"></p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            
                
                <div class="ftd22-faq__accordion ">
                    <p class="ftd22-faq__accordion-title">
                        <button class="ftd22-faq__accordion-title-cta" data-js-action="ftd22AccordionOpen">
                            Is Galaxy S25 FE waterproof?
                            
                        </button>
                    </p>
                    <div class="ftd22-faq__accordion-content-wrap">
                        <div class="ftd22-faq__accordion-content">
                            <p class="ftd22-faq__accordion-desc">Galaxy S25 FE is rated IP68 for water and dust resistance. This means it can handle being submerged in up to 1.5 meters of freshwater for up to 30 minutes under lab conditions. It's well protected against everyday spills and rain, but extended exposure to water — especially saltwater or high-pressure streams — should still be avoided.
                                
                            </p>
                            <p class="ftd22-faq__accordion-disclaimer">*Galaxy S25 FE is rated as IP68. Based on lab test conditions for submersion in up to 1.5 meters of freshwater for up to 30 minutes and for protection against a solid object greater than 1 mm such as a wire. Not advised for beach or pool use. Water resistance of device is not permanent and may diminish over time due to normal wear and tear. Not dust or sand-resistant.</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            
                
                <div class="ftd22-faq__accordion ">
                    <p class="ftd22-faq__accordion-title">
                        <button class="ftd22-faq__accordion-title-cta" data-js-action="ftd22AccordionOpen">
                            Can I transfer my data from iOS?
                            
                        </button>
                    </p>
                    <div class="ftd22-faq__accordion-content-wrap">
                        <div class="ftd22-faq__accordion-content">
                            <p class="ftd22-faq__accordion-desc">Yes, transferring data from an iOS device is simple with Samsung’s Smart Switch app. You can move contacts, photos, messages, apps, and more — either wirelessly or with a USB cable — for a smooth transition to your new phone.
                                
                            </p>
                            <p class="ftd22-faq__accordion-disclaimer">*Wired transfers from iOS require the receiving device to have Android™ 4.3 or later and the sending device to have iOS 5 or later. Transfers can be completed without a cable through a wireless connection or iCloud. For wireless connections, the receiving device must have Android™ 4.0 or later and the sending device must have iOS 12 or later. iCloud transfers require the receiving device to have Android™ 4.0 or later and the sending device to have iOS 5 or later. For wireless transfers, download Smart Switch for iOS from the App Store on your iPhone or iPad. Data, content and apps available for transfer may vary by transmission method. Contacts, gallery, videos, calendars and reminders can be transferred wirelessly from an iOS device.*It is recommended to use a wired connection when transferring diverse sets of data at once.*Please visit the Smart Switch page for more information.</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            
                
                <div class="ftd22-faq__accordion ">
                    <p class="ftd22-faq__accordion-title">
                        <button class="ftd22-faq__accordion-title-cta" data-js-action="ftd22AccordionOpen">
                            How is my data protected on Galaxy S25 FE?
                            
                        </button>
                    </p>
                    <div class="ftd22-faq__accordion-content-wrap">
                        <div class="ftd22-faq__accordion-content">
                            <p class="ftd22-faq__accordion-desc">Galaxy S25 FE features advanced security technology to help protect your personal information. Samsung Knox Vault safeguards sensitive data like passwords and biometrics in a secure hardware environment. The phone also processes much of your data locally to enhance privacy, and includes post-quantum cryptography for added future protection. With One UI’s privacy controls, you can easily manage what data is shared. Theft protection features provide an added layer of security if your device is ever lost or stolen.
                                
                            </p>
                            <p class="ftd22-faq__accordion-disclaimer"></p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            
                
                <div class="ftd22-faq__accordion ">
                    <p class="ftd22-faq__accordion-title">
                        <button class="ftd22-faq__accordion-title-cta" data-js-action="ftd22AccordionOpen">
                            How much is the Samsung Galaxy S25 FE?
                            
                        </button>
                    </p>
                    <div class="ftd22-faq__accordion-content-wrap">
                        <div class="ftd22-faq__accordion-content">
                            <p class="ftd22-faq__accordion-desc">The Samsung Galaxy S25 FE is priced at Rs.219,999 in Pakistan for the 256GB eStore exclusive model.
                                
                            </p>
                            <p class="ftd22-faq__accordion-disclaimer"></p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            
                
                <div class="ftd22-faq__accordion ">
                    <p class="ftd22-faq__accordion-title">
                        <button class="ftd22-faq__accordion-title-cta" data-js-action="ftd22AccordionOpen">
                            What processor powers the Galaxy S25 FE?
                            
                        </button>
                    </p>
                    <div class="ftd22-faq__accordion-content-wrap">
                        <div class="ftd22-faq__accordion-content">
                            <p class="ftd22-faq__accordion-desc">The Galaxy S25 FE is powered by the Exynos 2400 processor built on a 4nm process, delivering strong efficiency and flagship-level performance.
                                
                            </p>
                            <p class="ftd22-faq__accordion-disclaimer"></p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            
                
                <div class="ftd22-faq__accordion ">
                    <p class="ftd22-faq__accordion-title">
                        <button class="ftd22-faq__accordion-title-cta" data-js-action="ftd22AccordionOpen">
                            How much RAM and storage do the Galaxy S25 FE models offer?
                            
                        </button>
                    </p>
                    <div class="ftd22-faq__accordion-content-wrap">
                        <div class="ftd22-faq__accordion-content">
                            <p class="ftd22-faq__accordion-desc">The Galaxy S25 FE comes with 8GB of RAM and 256GB of internal storage in the eStore exclusive model available in Pakistan.
                                
                            </p>
                            <p class="ftd22-faq__accordion-disclaimer"></p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            
                
                <div class="ftd22-faq__accordion ">
                    <p class="ftd22-faq__accordion-title">
                        <button class="ftd22-faq__accordion-title-cta" data-js-action="ftd22AccordionOpen">
                            What are the display sizes and screen types of the Galaxy S25 FE?
                            
                        </button>
                    </p>
                    <div class="ftd22-faq__accordion-content-wrap">
                        <div class="ftd22-faq__accordion-content">
                            <p class="ftd22-faq__accordion-desc">The phone features a 6.7-inch Dynamic AMOLED 2X display with a 120Hz refresh rate, providing smooth scrolling and vivid color reproduction.
                                
                            </p>
                            <p class="ftd22-faq__accordion-disclaimer"></p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            
                
                <div class="ftd22-faq__accordion ">
                    <p class="ftd22-faq__accordion-title">
                        <button class="ftd22-faq__accordion-title-cta" data-js-action="ftd22AccordionOpen">
                            What are the camera specifications of the Galaxy S25 FE?
                            
                        </button>
                    </p>
                    <div class="ftd22-faq__accordion-content-wrap">
                        <div class="ftd22-faq__accordion-content">
                            <p class="ftd22-faq__accordion-desc">The Galaxy S25 FE has a triple rear camera system with a 50MP wide main sensor with OIS, a 12MP ultra-wide sensor, and an 8MP telephoto lens with 3x optical zoom, alongside a 12MP front camera for selfies.
                                
                            </p>
                            <p class="ftd22-faq__accordion-disclaimer"></p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            
                
                <div class="ftd22-faq__accordion ">
                    <p class="ftd22-faq__accordion-title">
                        <button class="ftd22-faq__accordion-title-cta" data-js-action="ftd22AccordionOpen">
                            Does the Galaxy S25 FE support fast charging?
                            
                        </button>
                    </p>
                    <div class="ftd22-faq__accordion-content-wrap">
                        <div class="ftd22-faq__accordion-content">
                            <p class="ftd22-faq__accordion-desc">Yes, the Galaxy S25 FE supports fast charging with 45W wired charging and 15W wireless charging for quick power top-ups.
                                
                            </p>
                            <p class="ftd22-faq__accordion-disclaimer"></p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            
                
                <div class="ftd22-faq__accordion ">
                    <p class="ftd22-faq__accordion-title">
                        <button class="ftd22-faq__accordion-title-cta" data-js-action="ftd22AccordionOpen">
                            What materials are used in the design of the Galaxy S25 FE?
                            
                        </button>
                    </p>
                    <div class="ftd22-faq__accordion-content-wrap">
                        <div class="ftd22-faq__accordion-content">
                            <p class="ftd22-faq__accordion-desc">The phone is constructed with Gorilla Glass Victus+ on the back and an aluminum frame, offering both durability and a premium design.
                                
                            </p>
                            <p class="ftd22-faq__accordion-disclaimer"></p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            
                
                <div class="ftd22-faq__accordion ">
                    <p class="ftd22-faq__accordion-title">
                        <button class="ftd22-faq__accordion-title-cta" data-js-action="ftd22AccordionOpen">
                            What connectivity options does the Galaxy S25 FE support?
                            
                        </button>
                    </p>
                    <div class="ftd22-faq__accordion-content-wrap">
                        <div class="ftd22-faq__accordion-content">
                            <p class="ftd22-faq__accordion-desc">Yes, the Galaxy S25 FE supports connectivity features such as 5G, 4G LTE, Wi-Fi, Bluetooth, USB-C, and eSIM.
                                
                            </p>
                            <p class="ftd22-faq__accordion-disclaimer"></p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            
            
        </div>
    </section>



		
	


</div>

					
				
					
